{quote}Is it possible to correct the invoice in that period when the error occurred? I mean, for example, if a commission was calculated incorrectly in the period 02-08.12.24, is it possible to re-issue an invoice for the period 02-08.12.24 with the correct commission sum?{quote}

No, it is not possible to adjust or reissue an existing invoice if the correction is made a week after its issuance. Please ensure that any corrections you’d like to make are done within the same weekly period. This is because our balances and financial reports rely on timestamps. Adjusting outside the relevant period would result in manipulating data and misrepresenting the actual timeline of events.

