In the envcommon modules parameters should be declared explicitly. Unstructured objects worked in old module:

{noformat}variable "spec" {
  default = {}
}{noformat}

However envcommon module defines object structure:

{noformat}variable "spec" {
  type = object({...})
}{noformat}

So every {{spec.*}} parameter needs to be described in {{type}}, otherwise it’s not accessible from the module code.

There are more parameters than need to be fixed; handled in [https://github.com/bolteu/terraform-main/pull/11066|https://github.com/bolteu/terraform-main/pull/11066].

